  "id": "proteus-syndrome",
  "term": "Proteus syndrome",
  "definition": "Proteus syndrome is a malformation disorder of uncertain cause marked by uneven, excessive growth in parts of the body, especially the hands, feet, and limbs. It can also involve skin, fatty, blood-vessel, and lymph-vessel overgrowths, along with an unusually large head and overgrowth of skull and long bones.",
